rule c1xx: function-template instances are compiled after every function of the file, in the order they were first needed: f g h, then t2 t1
cl /O2 /Ob0
obj
  section * .text code * ?f@@YAHH@Z
  section * .text code * ?g@@YAHH@Z
  section * .text code * ?h@@YAHH@Z
  section * .text code * comdat=any ?t2@@YAHH@Z
  section * .text code * comdat=any ?t1@@YAHH@Z
